ponents, locate the <strong>8 Hexa-devices</strong> that must be destroyed, and face their tremendous guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/d5be443270e30adce84bf4bbc77ba976.poster.avif?t=1731925678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/d5be443270e30adce84bf4bbc77ba976.webm?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/d5be443270e30adce84bf4bbc77ba976.mp4?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Vast World to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across <strong>Hexa-Earth</strong>, a planet with diverse biomes ranging from mysterious jungles to the stratosphere, passing through the skies and oceans. Encounter various robots, both friend and foe, and face unexpected challenges along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/6f26161405832744d31b6a657b80106e.avif?t=1731925678\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich and Varied Experiences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch into a vibrant adventure filled with teleportations, powerful upgrades for <strong>R Body</strong>, and epic battles against colossal bosses. Each level brings surprises and unpredictable events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great deal of mystery lies within this world \u2014 it\u2019s up to you to uncover it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/57105065fe5f9cf614a122d13cf60d6d.poster.avif?t=1731925678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/57105065fe5f9cf614a122d13cf60d6d.webm?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/57105065fe5f9cf614a122d13cf60d6d.mp4?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/580e06aa80ac13fa8870d0e99f5753e7.poster.avif?t=1731925678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/580e06aa80ac13fa8870d0e99f5753e7.webm?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/580e06aa80ac13fa8870d0e99f5753e7.mp4?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/0b7d398577c70f94938c219114feb317.poster.avif?t=1731925678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/0b7d398577c70f94938c219114feb317.webm?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/0b7d398577c70f94938c219114feb317.mp4?t=1731925678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464450/extras/8e4070b956e7911be3029289bf54a3f7.avif?t=1731925678\" /></span></p>",
